Create ILM and Template

Create an index lifecycle management policy in Elasticsearch | Elastic Docs
Below policy will rotate index daily or if size increase 2 gb and will delete index older then 5 days 
Use DEV tool in kibana to execute belwo commands or use curl X post to execute them 
Step 1 : create ILM policy 
PUT _ilm/policy/rollover-then-delete
{
  "policy": {
    "phases": {
      "hot": {
        "min_age": "0ms",
        "actions": {
          "set_priority": {
            "priority": 100
          },
          "rollover": {
            "max_primary_shard_size": "2gb",
            "max_age": "1d"
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "min_age": "5d",
        "actions": {
          "delete": {
            "delete_searchable_snapshot": true
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

Step 2 : create template 


PUT _index_template/fortinet-template
{
  "index_patterns": ["fortinet-rollover-*"],
  "template": {
    "settings": {
      "number_of_shards": 1,
      "number_of_replicas": 0,
      "index.lifecycle.name": "rollover-then-delete",
      "index.lifecycle.rollover_alias": "fortinet-alias"
    }
  }
}

